  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Woord en Daad - Job Booster Burkina Faso 2017-2022</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project overall objective is to decrease poverty levels through increased employment in Burkina Faso. The project will focus in influencing public policies, improve quality and relevance of 41 vocational TVET centres in three regions, 20,833 rural and urban vulnerable young people will have access to quality vocational training and young people will be trained for sustainable income. The target troup is job seekers between 15-24, in particular underprivileged and at least 50% will be girls.</narrative>
  </description>
